/Producer (pypdf)
/Title (Two-rotation construction of the bracket frame)
/Subject (Two vertically stacked diagrams construct a bracket coordinate frame. Panel A rotates the intermediate x axis about the fixed space z axis until it points to the sagittal-plane projection of attachment point p A or p B. Panel B rotates about the current y axis until the final bracket x axis points to the full three-dimensional attachment point.)
/AltText (Two vertically stacked diagrams construct a bracket coordinate frame. Panel A rotates the intermediate x axis about the fixed space z axis until it points to the sagittal-plane projection of attachment point p A or p B. Panel B rotates about the current y axis until the final bracket x axis points to the full three-dimensional attachment point.)
